**Entra ID Objects and Role Based Access Control (RBAC)**

**Objective:**
Showcase the joiner part of identity lifecycle management and Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) using Microsoft Entra ID.

**This lab showcases:**
  -Manual user povisioning (joiner process)
  -Security group creation
  -Group-based access control
  -Role delegation using the principle of least privilege
---
**Scenario:**
There are three new users joining the organization (note these users are ficticious and not based on any singular person(s)):
  - Adam Grey: Controller
  - Denise Sutton: Talent Acquisition Specialist
  - Lily Polk: System Support Specialist
These three users will need corporate accounts along with being added to the correct security group.
